# This directory is a HOUSEKEEPING BOARD: every `…/$defs:task` file in it is a card (a chore),
# grouped into lanes by the `dev` workflow's states (backlog → ready → in-progress → done/cancelled).
# Dragging a card to another lane rewrites that chore's state annotation (re-tags it). The
# states come from the PROJECT-GLOBAL `dev` workflow (the root `ontos/` taxonomy) that the cards
# also point at — one source of truth, no per-board copy. A member no lane references (the
# grocery list) shows in the board's "other" section. Spec: ../../TICKETS.md §3.
!!<*yamlover:$defs:board>
workflow: *::yamlover:ontos:workflow:dev
